本项目基于并致谢前辈小女仆模组系列的代码与架构（保留其原始许可证）：
- LittleMaidMob (1.7.10) — 作者 MMM（https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob）
- LittleMaidReengaged 小女改 (1.12.2) — 作者 firis-games 与 Verclene（https://github.com/firis-games/LittleMaidReengagedFirisPatch）
- LittleMaidReBirth 重置版 (1.20.1) 与 LittleMaidModelLoader (LMML) — 作者 Sistr（https://github.com/SistrScarlet/LittleMaidReBirth-Architectury）
以上前辈作品及其内嵌组件（含 `net.sistr.littlemaidmodelloader` 包）各自仍受其原许可证约束
（如 LittleMaid Licence：© MMM, EMB4, Verclene, firis-games, Sistr）；本 MIT 许可证仅适用于本项目自身新增与改编的代码。

This project is based on and thanks to the code and architecture of the
predecessor little-maid mod series (which retain their original licenses):
- LittleMaidMob (1.7.10) by MMM (https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob)
- LittleMaidReengaged (1.12.2) by firis-games & Verclene (https://github.com/firis-games/LittleMaidReengagedFirisPatch)
- LittleMaidReBirth Remake (1.20.1) and LittleMaidModelLoader (LMML) by Sistr (https://github.com/SistrScarlet/LittleMaidReBirth-Architectury)
The predecessor works and their bundled components (including the
`net.sistr.littlemaidmodelloader` package) remain under their respective
original licenses (e.g. the LittleMaid Licence: (C) MMM, EMB4, Verclene,
firis-games, Sistr); this MIT license applies only to this project's own new
and adapted code.
